{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author per-block review receipt: 29 PASS rows for integration reconciler comment remediation.\nReviewer session: agent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\nImmutable before: ba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419\nMerged final: a242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c\nThe merged tree is byte-identical to reviewed patchset 83129b25017591d11c666463ee702ce73e2fbf5b on this leaf's changed paths.\nSchema: path<TAB>anchor/kind<TAB>before-citation<TAB>after-citation<TAB>preserved-contract-or-consumer<TAB>before-words<TAB>after-words<TAB>semantic-preservation<TAB>bloat-removal<TAB>reviewer-session\n\n```tsv\ntests/integration/reconciler/conftest.py\tD:_default_jira_project\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/conftest.py:L26-40\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/conftest.py:L26-30\tPin a valid REB project and hermetic Cloud credentials for these integration tests, while allowing per-test overrides and restoring the prior environment afterward. Inbound fetch rejects an empty project; backend construction rejects missing credentials or a non-email Cloud user.\t137\t39\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py:L1-19\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py:L1-4\tReplay scrubbed Jira fixtures through production fetch and enrichment. The fake exposes the real client signatures, returns captured shapes without reshaping, and isolates callers with deep copies.\t146\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py\tD:FakeAcliClient\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py:L33-40\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py:L18-20\tMatch the real client constructor and method signatures. Return deep copies of captured payloads so one test cannot mutate another test's fixture state.\t63\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py\tD:install\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py:L68-75\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/_fakes.py:L48-51\tInject the fake transport through fetcher's production _load_acli seam. Production snapshot enrichment then merges the captured parent, comment, and link shapes without a parallel serialization path.\t52\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_jira_fixtures.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_jira_fixtures.py:L1-19\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_jira_fixtures.py:L1-4\tCheck captured Jira fixtures with broader secret detectors than the scrubber, then feed them through production snapshot enrichment without reshaping comments, links, or parents.\t149\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_jira_fixtures.py\tC:Ticket 88d9 INVERTED\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_jira_fixtures.py:L86-92\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_jira_fixtures.py:L71-72\tA present, null parent proves Jira was queried and this top-level issue is parentless; absence of the key could mean a failed read and cannot justify a clear.\t98\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_roundtrip.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_roundtrip.py:L1-23\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_roundtrip.py:L1-4\tRound-trip captured comments, links in both directions, and parents through the production fetch, differ, and apply paths. The read-only fake supplies inbound data; a recording write client proves outbound convergence without live Jira.\t155\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py:L1-20\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py:L1-4\tPin the producer-consumer snapshot contract through production fetch and differ paths. Schema checks catch missing or flat keys; discriminating mutations prove that nested comments, links, parents, and scalar fields are actually read.\t158\t32\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py\tD:test_producer_carries_enrichment_keys\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py:L133-140\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py:L117-120\tThe producer retains nested comments, issuelinks, and parent keys. Assert their shape rather than fixture values so recaptured data can change without hiding a contract regression.\t64\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py\tD:test_inbound_reads_comment_field_and_would_miss_prefix\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py:L192-200\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_snapshot_contract.py:L172-175\tInbound reads comment.comments: removing echo markers must increase emitted adds from zero to the fixture count. A flat comments key would leave both runs at zero.\t75\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_verified_fake_contract.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_verified_fake_contract.py:L1-23\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_verified_fake_contract.py:L1-4\tRun the shared Jira shape contract against the hermetic fake. The same contract runs against the real client in the opt-in external tier; a deliberately divergent fake proves this check rejects fictional shapes.\t182\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_verified_fake_contract.py\tC:The honesty mechanism\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_verified_fake_contract.py:L57-61\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/jira_contract/test_verified_fake_contract.py:L38-38\tA divergent fake must fail the shared contract instead of hiding shape drift.\t35\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_leaves_invocable.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_leaves_invocable.py:L1-7\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_leaves_invocable.py:L1-3\tInvoke a post-deletion leaf and check an observable result. The sibling linkage test only checks the registry; this test exposes import and dispatch failures.\t51\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_leaves_invocable.py\tD:test_outbound_probe_leaf_genuinely_invocable\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_leaves_invocable.py:L26-36\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_leaves_invocable.py:L22-25\tInvoke the read-only outbound probe through its real import and dispatch chain. Assert the fetched issue, direction, action, and client key; propagate any error.\t97\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py:L1-29\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py:L1-4\tVerify implemented bidirectional ADD-only link sync. Local deps produce Jira relationship mutations, and Jira issuelinks produce local deps; both tests use the real binding and relationship shapes.\t220\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py\tD:test_outbound_emits_link_mutation_for_local_blocks_link\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py:L112-121\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py:L87-89\tA local blocks dep between bound tickets emits a Jira Blocks relationship with the target's bound key.\t58\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py\tD:test_inbound_reflects_jira_issuelink_into_rebar\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py:L155-169\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_link_sync.py:L123-125\tA Jira Blocks issuelink between bound issues emits the corresponding local dep, preserving Jira link direction.\t95\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py:L1-11\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py:L1-4\tCheck post-deletion typed-dispatch registry linkage: expected leaves still import and appear in _LEAVES. Actual leaf invocation is covered by test_leaves_invocable.py.\t89\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py\tD:test_leaves_registry_linkage_intact\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py:L53-61\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py:L41-43\tThe registry contains exactly the expected direction/action pairs and callable leaves; import failure breaks module load. Invocation is checked separately.\t79\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py\t\"C:(\"\"inbound\"\", \"\"delete\"\") and\"\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py:L29-35\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_post_deletion_linkage.py:L22-23\tInbound probe is unreachable, and inbound delete would resurrect a Jira deletion. Outbound probe remains live for bounded absence checks.\t77\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py:L1-19\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py:L1-5\tExercise two-pass idempotency in a real git-backed ticket store. The unit fixture lacks the ticket CLI's git context and can pass vacuously; this test makes imported tickets visible to the outbound differ and requires zero second-pass mutations and Jira writes.\t141\t40\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py\tD:test_out_of_window_404_then_alive_roundtrip_clears_absence\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py:L510-513\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py:L485-487\tA 404 stamps absence with the injected lifecycle clock; a later alive GET reaches clear_absent and resets the counter without churn.\t44\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py\tC:Advance the external clock\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py:L349-362\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_idempotency.py:L335-337\tFreeze both module clocks so same-second passes cannot hide a write. Absence operations read binding_lifecycle's clock; the in-window pass does not reach them, while the direct lifecycle test covers no-churn behavior.\t121\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L1-31\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L1-4\tChain outbound and inbound pure differs through the Jira storage shape to require fixed-point convergence. Cover ADF description fitting, lossy status labels, parent binding, comment echo suppression, and link direction without live Jira.\t261\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py\tD:test_description_survives_outbound_adf_inbound_unchanged\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L155-162\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L126-128\tOutbound ADF encoding followed by inbound decoding preserves the local description, allowing trailing-newline normalization without an inbound change.\t60\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py\tD:test_oversize_description_truncated_by_jira_not_pulled_back\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L194-209\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L160-163\tJira's ADF limit truncates the sent copy, not the local description. Both differs compare fitted values and emit no description change after the round trip.\t126\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py\tD:test_link_relationship_survives_roundtrip_without_reemit\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L485-491\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L439-441\tA local blocks dep becomes a Jira Blocks link; once Jira returns it, neither differ re-emits the relationship or re-imports the dep.\t66\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py\tC:Ticket 4af8:\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L47-49\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L20-20\tLoad the send-shape mapper from its Jira owner; the core differ receives it by injection.\t33\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\r\ntests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py\tC:Apply the link to the Jira snapshot\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L509-514\ta242031eb4ad1800ecb431abe5d2ffaa60ec712c:tests/integration/reconciler/test_reconcile_roundtrip.py:L459-460\t\"Jira returns \"\"DIG-7 blocks DIG-8\"\" as DIG-7's outwardIssue. Inbound maps that Blocks direction back to the existing local blocks dep.\"\t67\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group03:2026-10-22\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792746590028288116,"uuid":"63dd8db9-a88e-456c-bc69-3370867ec7f4"}